sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Declarative Agent
    participant S as MCP Server Data Tools
    participant J as JSON Fund Package
    participant H as Copilot Host
    participant W as MCP App Widget
    U->>A: Ask about grants or funding programs
    A->>S: list_funds({ category?, search? })
    S->>J: Read cached fund summaries
    J-->>S: Fund summaries
    S-->>A: Fund list
    A-->>U: Recommend fund options
    U->>A: Choose a fund
    A->>S: get_fund_details({ fundId })
    S->>J: Read fund details and short eligibility summary
    J-->>S: Browsing data
    S-->>A: Fund details without rubric
    A->>S: start_questionnaire({ fundId })
    S->>J: Read question graph
    J-->>S: Branching graph with one summary terminal
    S-->>A: Tool result with _meta.ui.resourceUri
    A-->>H: Render questionnaire result
    H-->>W: app.ontoolresult(start_questionnaire result)
    W-->>U: Show first question
    loop Branching questionnaire
        U->>W: Answer current question
        W->>W: Validate, store, compute next branch
        W->>H: app.updateModelContext(progress checkpoint)
        W-->>U: Show next reachable question
    end
    W-->>U: Show single summary and confirmation screen
    U->>W: Confirm final answers
    W->>H: app.updateModelContext({ fundId, fundName, answers, summary })
    W->>H: app.sendMessage(readable answer summary)
    H->>A: New user turn with confirmed answers
    A->>S: get_eligibility_criteria({ fundId })
    S->>J: Read criteria and evaluationGuidance
    J-->>S: Criteria, severity, remediation, guidance
    S-->>A: Model-visible criteria packet
    A->>A: Evaluate confirmed answers against fresh criteria packet
    A-->>U: Outcome and gap analysis
